370:            <p>In Lab 1's output, find the two-period price and the value after an up move. Check that they agree with Example 3.4.</p>
372:              <p>The output prints V0 = 45 = 4500 cents and the value after an up move as 75. Both match Example 3.4, where \(V(0,0) = 45\) and \(V(1,1) = 75\). The closed form printed on the next line also gives 45, so the backward induction and the path sum agree.</p></details></div>
